    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A proposed qualitative criterion for the Method Omega example, not an additional requirement asserted to have appeared in the supplied diagram or paper. It does not replace the recorded approval decision or imply that requirements have been approved.</skos:scopeNote>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">For the selected Method Omega execution and document versions, the wireframes and use cases provide sufficiently clear, mutually consistent descriptions of the intended behavior to support a requirements review.</skos:definition>
