    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Includes sending at 15:00Z and waiting for the partner reply, used at 17:15Z; ends at 17:30Z. The partner voting Activity occurs strictly within this interval. Its returning vote is received during execution, not required at the start.</rdfs:comment>
