    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://purl.org/net/p-plan#Variable"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Links a MultiStep to an output Variable produced by a Step in its decomposition and made available to consumers outside that decomposition. This exposes the same planned slot; it neither asserts another producer nor creates another artifact. Deliberately not a subproperty of p-plan:hasOutputVar, whose inverse is functional.</rdfs:comment>
